{"id":"3940fa6346d5986b","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-cof.md","title":"Cofinality of an Ideal","display":"df-cof — Cofinality of an Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cof","aliases":["58-df-cof"],"display":"df-cof — Cofinality of an Ideal","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cof — Cofinality of an Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,P\\in V\">\\(I,P\\in V\\)</span> (set-theoretic parameters)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|:V\\to V\">\\(|\\cdot|:V\\to V\\)</span> (基数函数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cof}:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cof}:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> (ideal-cofinality operator defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对非空序数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min C\\coloneqq\\iota c\\;(c\\in C\\land\\forall d\\in C\\;(c\\subseteq d))\">\\(\\min C\\coloneqq\\iota c\\;(c\\in C\\land\\forall d\\in C\\;(c\\subseteq d))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 仅在唯一见证存在时取值。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cof} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,P)\\to\\left(\\mathrm{Cof}(I) \\coloneqq \\min\\{\\lambda \\mid \\exists \\mathcal{F}\\subseteq I\\;(|\\mathcal{F}|=\\lambda \\land \\forall X\\in I\\;\\exists Y\\in\\mathcal{F}\\;(X\\subseteq Y))\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cof} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,P)\\to\\left(\\mathrm{Cof}(I) \\coloneqq \\min\\{\\lambda \\mid \\exists \\mathcal{F}\\subseteq I\\;(|\\mathcal{F}|=\\lambda \\land \\forall X\\in I\\;\\exists Y\\in\\mathcal{F}\\;(X\\subseteq Y))\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cof}(I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cof}(I)\\)</span> measures the size of a smallest cofinal family in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cof}(\\mathrm{NS}_{\\kappa}) \\geq \\kappa^{+}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cof}(\\mathrm{NS}_{\\kappa}) \\geq \\kappa^{+}\\)</span>in general.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2$ (ideal predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|\\cdot|:V\\to V$ (基数函数，见 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"|\\cdot|:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cof}:V\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\min C\\coloneqq\\iota c\\;(c\\in C\\land\\forall d\\in C\\;(c\\subseteq d))","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cof} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,P)\\to\\left(\\mathrm{Cof}(I) \\coloneqq \\min\\{\\lambda \\mid \\exists \\mathcal{F}\\subseteq I\\;(|\\mathcal{F}|=\\lambda \\land \\forall X\\in I\\;\\exists Y\\in\\mathcal{F}\\;(X\\subseteq Y))\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cof}(I)","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cof}(\\mathrm{NS}_{\\kappa}) \\geq \\kappa^{+}","display":false}],"bytes":1161,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-304","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-cof.md|58-df-cof]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["6e4f95381faac4f9","5fb1c2241d1943d1","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}